These JSON files are official HL7 FHIR R4 (v4.0.1) examples.
They were copied without modification from https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/.

Patient, encounter, condition, procedure and observation are the published
f001 examples (Pieter van de Heuvel, heart valve). The diagnostic report file
is the published collection Bundle diagnosticreport-example-f001-bloodexam.

